#: ../../source/docs/common-donation.rst:5 01b8c51ac6bc4c5789c736c989a5ed1b
msgid "Donating to ArduPilot project"
msgstr "向ArduPilot项目捐款"

#: ../../source/docs/common-donation.rst:7 aea6ad13d5c04ba7a2f6726e78aea1d7
msgid ""
"There are several ways of donating to ArduPilot and all donations large and "
"small help us keep things running smoothly. The preferred method is a paypal"
" donation to the ArduPilot Foundation, which is an Australian non-profit "
"incorporated association."
msgstr ""
"向ArduPilot捐款的方式多种多样，无论大小，所有捐款都有助于我们保持平稳运营。首选方式是通过PayPal向ArduPilot基金会捐款，该基金会是一家澳大利亚非营利社团法人。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-donation.rst:12 9dbd6389fd99406a98bc8e427e4622a5
msgid ""
"Direct `PayPal Donation to the ArduPilot Foundation "
"<https://ardupilot.org/donate>`__"
msgstr "`通过PayPal直接向ArduPilot基金会捐款 <https://ardupilot.org/donate>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-donation.rst:14 dcce4e3bd25f444080d1050e77e8e73a
msgid ""
"Bank transfer to the ArduPilot Foundation bank account. Account details "
"available on request to `partners@ardupilot.org "
"<mailto:partners@ardupilot.org>`__"
msgstr ""
"银行转账至ArduPilot基金会银行账户。账户详情可发送邮件至 `partners@ardupilot.org "
"<mailto:partners@ardupilot.org>`__ 索取"

#: ../../source/docs/common-donation.rst:16 49d389591e9c44aa9af19027c8cf051e
msgid ""
"Direct `PayPal Donation via SPI <https://www.paypal.com/cgi-"
"bin/webscr?cmd=_s-xclick&hosted_button_id=BBF28AFAD58B2>`__"
msgstr ""
"`通过SPI渠道PayPal直接捐款 <https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr?cmd=_s-"
"xclick&hosted_button_id=BBF28AFAD58B2>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-donation.rst:17 ea387a14e8d3406b8b11efd87614e841
msgid ""
"By Credit Card using `ClickAndPledge "
"<https://co.clickandpledge.com/advanced/default.aspx?wid=34115>`__.  Be sure"
" to enter the amount in the ArduPilot section, other sections are for other "
"`SPI projects <http://www.spi-inc.org/>`__.  Other methods can be found on "
"the `SPI donations page <http://www.spi-inc.org/donations/>`__."
msgstr ""
"通过信用卡使用 `ClickAndPledge "
"<https://co.clickandpledge.com/advanced/default.aspx?wid=34115>`__ "
"捐款。请确保在ArduPilot部分填写金额，其他部分用于其他 `SPI项目 <http://www.spi-inc.org/>`__。其他捐款方式可在"
" `SPI捐款页面 <http://www.spi-inc.org/donations/>`__ 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-donation.rst:18 895ff20116c6405cba85bf369d6a5ccb
msgid "Become a :doc:`Corporate Partner <common-partners>`"
msgstr "成为 :doc:`企业合作伙伴 <common-partners>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-donation.rst:20 3edff58ae340444c8bb548591110adc8
msgid ""
"`How are donations spent? <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-"
"partners-program.html#how-are-collected-funds-spent>`__"
msgstr ""
"`捐款如何使用？ <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-partners-"
"program.html#how-are-collected-funds-spent>`__"
